# Regenerable Unity/tooling directories excluded from the brief-003 port
# (Success Condition 1 / Success Condition 2). These must never become
# trackable, even after they are locally regenerated by a compile/test run.
/Library/
/Temp/
/Logs/
/obj/
/Builds/
/UserSettings/
/.vs/

# PresentationCache/ is NOT purely regenerable cache: VictoriaProject tracks
# 51 files at HEAD under game_unity/PresentationCache/ (feedback-001.md item
# 1 -- a planning defect in the original eight-directory exclusion list, not
# a Generateur error: brief.md's Success Condition 1 fixed that list and
# forbade silently narrowing it). 9 of those 51 are not self-regenerated by
# a Unity compile/test run (README.md + the 4 unit_* sprites
# MapSpriteOverlay.cs:138 names, each .png + its .stamp) and are bridged
# read-only from VictoriaProject, same discipline as the sandbox/geo and
# Logs/ bridges -- these 9 specific paths must stay trackable. The other 42
# files under PresentationCache/Sprites/ (building_*/city_*/prop_* sprites)
# regenerate themselves during a Unity run and remain ignored below.
/PresentationCache/*
!/PresentationCache/README.md
!/PresentationCache/Sprites/
/PresentationCache/Sprites/*
!/PresentationCache/Sprites/unit_cog_1400.png
!/PresentationCache/Sprites/unit_cog_1400.stamp
!/PresentationCache/Sprites/unit_galley_1400.png
!/PresentationCache/Sprites/unit_galley_1400.stamp
!/PresentationCache/Sprites/unit_carrack_1450.png
!/PresentationCache/Sprites/unit_carrack_1450.stamp
!/PresentationCache/Sprites/unit_galleon_1550.png
!/PresentationCache/Sprites/unit_galleon_1550.stamp

# Common Unity-adjacent regenerable artifacts (defense in depth, not part of
# the brief's fixed eight-directory list, and not relied upon by any
# Required Counter).
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db
sysinfo.txt
crashlytics-build.properties
